{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一拜已胡跪執爐云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一拜已復跪奉請云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三請一禮"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三請已一\n拜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三請已一拜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三請已不應禮"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此位眾唱三請已不禮，白衣須禮。當合掌持呪："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "姪字徒細地夜儞也，三曰並通"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "脯布乎切，𠷈力出切，折市列切，囇力計切，四並同之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "多可切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "喇字多達切，泥字去聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佗丑迦切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "頞烏\n割切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "娜乃可切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "比婢必切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鄔烏古切，呬香器切，羝了兮切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "頡戶結切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "入聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七遍訖一拜起，同聲嘆云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "讚已當陳述意，須合掌恭敬，令眾平聲三唱云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三稱已，次虔奉供養，專想\n面對，後陳辭句，餘時除去飲食，并淨潔如法，復持散擲等語，但云「香華至同圓種智」而止，便即禮佛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此亦應隨意所陳，未必專誦此語。作\n是語已，當持飲食至道場外淨處，布散四方，先作是言："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "作是呪願竟，即便以食散\n擲四方，想無量鬼神悉來受食。爾時或誦前呪，或但云「南無室利摩訶天女」，以食盡為度。散灑畢，迴道場禮\n佛。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三禮"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一拜運想逆順十心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "懺悔已歸命禮三寶"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "勸請已歸命禮三寶"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "隨喜已歸命禮三寶"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "迴向已歸命禮三寶"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "發願已歸命禮三寶"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三稱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "《嘉興藏》（日本東京大學綜合圖書館藏正編第193帙第3冊第40圖右欄第10行）"}
{"id": null, "n": "0961001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0961001", "type": "orig", "text": "【原】康熙六年刊增上寺報恩藏本"}
{"id": null, "n": "0962b1101", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0962b1101", "type": "add", "text": "虔【CB】【嘉興乙-CB】，處【大】"}
